        381.73065185546875,
        523.3890991210938,
        391.3633728027344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "which is a hybrid system with three modes. To introduce stochastic conditions, we add",
      "bbox": [
        89.60900115966797,
        395.2806396484375,
        521.8596801757812,
        404.9133605957031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "zero-mean Gaussian process noise, v ∼N(⃗027×1, Σv), where Σv = diag",
